WEBVTT

00:07:59.196 --> 00:08:00.476
to show leadership on.

00:08:00.516 --> 00:08:01.996
BG: What was your exact demand?

00:08:02.036 --> 00:08:05.436
Redraw the lines? Suspend it?
Change it? Reanalyze it?

00:08:05.436 --> 00:08:08.716
NS: Well, the license
was granted 20 years ago.

00:08:08.756 --> 00:08:10.796
There is a process
now it has to go through

00:08:10.836 --> 00:08:13.356
to get approval for development.

00:08:13.356 --> 00:08:15.236
And my argument is

00:08:15.236 --> 00:08:18.996
just if a company was now applying
for a new licence,

00:08:19.036 --> 00:08:21.796
there would have to be
a climate compatibility check.

00:08:21.836 --> 00:08:24.396
Now, arguably that's not robust enough,

00:08:24.396 --> 00:08:26.556
but the same thing should happen

00:08:26.596 --> 00:08:31.316
if our existing license
is turned into development consent.